[{
    "id": 2,
    "question": "In the figure given, parallel lines, AB and CD, are intercepted by a transversal t at E and F, respectively. If EG is the angle bisector of $\\angle AEF$, find $\\angle EGF$.<br><br><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width: 400px; height: auto; display: block; margin: 10px auto;\"><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"275\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"25\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"77\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"100\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#000000\"/><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"200\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#000000\"/><circle cx=\"77\" cy=\"200\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#000000\"/><text x=\"35\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">A</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">B</text><text x=\"35\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">C</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">D</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">E</text><text x=\"185\" y=\"225\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">F</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"225\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">G</text><text x=\"255\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"16\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">t</text><path d=\"M 210 200 A 30 30 0 0 0 191.1 172.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"185\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">$70^{\\circ}$</text><path d=\"M 190 100 A 30 30 0 0 0 208.9 127.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg>",
    "options": [
      "35°",
      "85°",
      "60°",
      "90°"
    ],
    "answer": "60°",
    "explanation": "AB ∥ CD। F বিন্দুতে ∠CFE = 180° − 70° = 110°। আবার ∠GFE = 110° − 25° = 85°। যেহেতু EG হল ∠AEF-এর সমদ্বিখণ্ডক এবং AB ∥ CD, তাই ∠AEF = 70° এবং ∠GEF = 35°। এখন ত্রিভুজ EGF-এ, ∠EGF = 180° − (35° + 85°) = 60°। অতএব, সঠিক উত্তর = 60°।"
  }]
